Package: hexmap
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Hexagonal Watershed Mapping and Spatial Projection
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-08-10
Authors@R: person("Brian S.", "Yandell", email = "brian.yandell@wisc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Interactive discovery of USGS HUC subwatershed boundaries using Leaflet, dynamic feature isolation (such as island landmasses via OpenStreetMap), and mathematical projection of hexagonal substrate grid networks.
